    "__COMMENT__ example of 'dance_minutes'. A dance listed here is played for that many minutes instead of a set number of songs. Any announcement or cue before the block counts toward the budget. Songs are drawn until the budget is reached, then a single uniform trim is spread across every song in the block so it ends on time; each song keeps its own length minus that shared trim. 'dance_max_playtimes' still caps any one long song.": {
        "dance_minutes": {
            "Waltz": 13,
            "VienneseWaltz": 8
        }
    },
