    "__COMMENT__ 'segments' replaces the dances list and builds competition rounds. A segment is either a cue (an audio file in cues/, played to its natural length) or a round. In a round each dance is played 'count' times for 'clip_seconds', separated by a 'gap_seconds' gap. 'fade_seconds' fades the end of each clip and is taken out of the clip rather than added to it, so the round keeps its length; omit it and the clip stops dead. Rounds have no spoken announcements unless 'announce' is true.": {
        "segments": [
            {
                "cue": "round_gap",
                "label": "2:00 break"
            },
            {
                "round": [
                    "Waltz",
                    "Tango"
                ],
                "count": 1,
                "clip_seconds": 90,
                "gap_seconds": 20,
                "label": "Final"
            }
        ]
    },
